- Revenue contribution: Quarterly revenue of $670K (~$223K/month) covers a portion of operating expenses, but not all.
- Expense posture: Implied monthly operating spend is ~ $483K (revenue $223K + net burn $260K).
- Burn trend: If spend continues at current levels, cash will be exhausted in ~20 months — this requires active management to avoid an unplanned financing crunch.
Implications and recommendation
