- “Current cash balance is $5.2M, which yields approximately 20 months of runway under our current plan (implied net cash burn ≈ $260K/month). Last quarter revenue was $670K (monthly ≈ $223K). The gap between revenue and total operating spend remains the primary driver of cash depletion. Over the next 12 months we will prioritize revenue acceleration and targeted cost control to extend runway and preserve strategic flexibility.”

