- Cash balance timeline (last 12–24 months) with actual vs. forecast lines
- Monthly cash inflows (revenue) vs. cash outflows (COGS, Opex, Capex, financing) — stacked bars
- Runway under three scenarios: Base, Best (accelerated revenue/reduced spend), and Worst (revenue decline)
- Key KPI table: monthly revenue, gross margin, core burn, net burn, AR days, committed capex, headcount by function

