- If runway = 20 months (implied net burn $260K): “As of today Metro Manufacturing holds $5.2M in cash, which at our projected net burn rate implies ~20 months of runway. Last quarter revenue was $670K (≈$223K/month). Given the current pace of cash consumption, priority actions over the next 6–12 months are to (1) accelerate revenue growth, (2) identify targeted cost savings, and (3) finalize our funding plan to maintain runway and support strategic initiatives.”

Recommended next steps (practical)
